            "encoding_backend=PE + encoder_mode=bluray"
          ],
          "result": "All three variants succeed and produce identical EC3 output. When encoding_backend is omitted or set to PE, DEE warns that PE backend is unsupported for Blu-ray mode and falls back to atmosprocessor.",
